Package: dolt
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: SQL database with Git-style version control
 Dolt is a relational SQL database that you can fork, clone, branch,
 merge, push and pull exactly like a Git repository. It treats data the
 way source code is treated: collaborate, review diffs, roll back
 mistakes, and reconstruct any prior state of the data.
 .
 This package provides the `dolt` command-line client together with the
 bundled `noms` chunk-store inspection tool and the `remotesrv`
 remote-storage helper.
